# LF everywhere. The Dockerfile and the shell commands in the compose files
# are executed inside Linux containers, where CRLF is a syntax error.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The design export is committed as a byte-exact copy of the Claude Design
# project — DESIGN_INVENTORY.md's traceability claims rest on that. Excluding
# it from text normalisation keeps the bytes identical on a Windows clone.
docs/design/** -text
